\n\n当前故意将 version 命令的成功退出码预期写成 1（真实值为 0），首次 CI 应失败。草稿期间等待管理员启用 main 的必需检查和严格保护；确认规则后转为 ready，保存普通合并被拒的日志，再在同一 PR 将预期修复为 0，记录成功 CI、Artifact 和正常合并。\n\n已归档的课程服务器运行对应 a887b574a61524b967f731889ca5523f40684730，16 项服务测试、17 项独立测试、八场景门禁与原始证据审计通过。文本快照位于 evidence/E7/241830088/course-20261026/，原始 trace、输入和检测报告保持原字节，SHA256 清单覆盖 211 个文件。\n\n首次错误断言只是课程演示，修复前保持草稿状态。整合代码已由 PR #7 合入 main；本 PR 将单独记录故障注入与恢复的运行身份。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T14:22:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:51:48Z","closed_at":"2026-10-26T17:51:48Z","merged_at":"2026-10-26T17:51:48Z","merge_commit_sha":"99cc7e01d4562d2357470ed14585c0d587fb76df","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Dufunare:e7/241830088-protected-demo","ref":"e7/241830088-protected-demo","repo":{"id":1377843759,"node_id":"R_kgDOUiA6Lw","name":"2026-Devops-A13","full_name":"Dufunare/2026-Devops-A13","owner":{"login":"Dufunare","id":223224354,"node_id":"U_kgDODU4iIg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223224354?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare","html_url":"https://github.com/Dufunare","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dufunare/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"Python","visib